# Aether project rule

Before non-trivial edits, consult:

- `docs/MEMORY.md` (design decisions, lobby/logo invariants)
- `docs/SPEC.md` when changing gameplay contracts
- `AGENTS.md` for agent workflow

## Hard invariants

- Keep simulation (`lib` modules) free of Macroquad.
- Put balance constants in `src/tune.rs`.
- Lobby backdrop must fill the full window (no black letterbox from `dish_fit_rect`).
- Organisms are controlled only by genome-derived neural nets — no scripted behavior FSMs.
- UI copy is Czech.
- Update `docs/MEMORY.md` when you change lasting design decisions.
